Third-party material: dsRIP terminal duplex-energy table
========================================================

Files in this directory derived from third-party material:

  dsrip_lookup.db             verbatim copy of lookup.db from the deposit below
  dsrip_terminal_energies.tsv deterministic text export of the same 256 values

Source
------

  Cedden D. dsRIP web platform v1.0. figshare, 2025.
  DOI: 10.6084/m9.figshare.28156787 (resolved version v3, posted 2025-03-16)

  Described in: Cedden D, Guney G, Rostas M, Bucher G. Optimizing dsRNA
  sequences for RNAi in pest control and research with the dsRIP web platform.
  BMC Biology, 2025. DOI: 10.1186/s12915-025-02219-6

