Underlying thermodynamic parameters
-----------------------------------

The 256 values were generated from the nearest-neighbour helix model of:

  Zuber J, Schroeder SJ, Sun H, Turner DH, Mathews DH. Nearest neighbor rules
  for RNA helix folding thermodynamics: improved end effects. Nucleic Acids
  Research, 2022;50(9):5251-5262. DOI: 10.1093/nar/gkac261

That derivation was verified independently for this project; see
provenance.json. This notice records the scientific provenance of the values and
does not alter the license above, which governs the files as distributed.
